: 106.96, "text": " Felt like we were in a die-hard movie.", "tokens": [51331, 376, 2120, 588, 356, 547, 287, 257, 4656, 12, 10424, 3807, 13, 51399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675205833033512, "compression_ratio": 1.7299771167048055, "no_speech_prob": 0.022070296108722687}, {"id": 53, "seek": 8624, "start": 106.96, "end": 109.19999999999999, "text": " Now we're, we get notified that they have the blow thing early.", "tokens": [51399, 2735, 356, 821, 11, 356, 651, 17600, 326, 484, 423, 262, 6611, 1517, 1903, 13, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675205833033512, "compression_ratio": 1.7299771167048055, "no_speech_prob": 0.022070296108722687}, {"id": 54, "seek": 8624, "start": 109.19999999999999, "end": 113.44, "text": " So we are forced to abandon the trucks on a service time longer five.", "tokens": [51511, 1406, 356, 389, 4137, 284, 6871, 262, 13960, 319, 257, 2139, 640, 2392, 1936, 13, 51723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675205833033512, "compression_ratio": 1.7299771167048055, "no_speech_prob": 0.022070296108722687}, {"id": 55, "seek": 8624, "start": 113.44, "end": 116.0, "text": " Then we moved on to seven to wipe some financial records towards the place.", "tokens": [51723, 3244, 356, 3888, 319, 284, 3598, 284, 19916, 617, 3176, 4406, 3371, 262, 1295, 13, 51851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675205833033512, "compression_ratio": 1.7299771167048055, "no_speech_prob": 0.022070296108722687}, {"id": 56, "seek": 11600, "start": 116.0, "end": 119.36, "text": " We find the deputy director of the emergency services department wandering around the command center.", "tokens": [50363, 775, 1064, 262, 10636, 3437, 286, 262, 6334, 2594, 5011, 24504, 1088, 262, 3141, 3641, 13, 50531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 57, "seek": 11600, "start": 119.36, "end": 120.56, "text": " He says his name was Barry.", "tokens": [50531, 679, 1139, 465, 1438, 373, 14488, 13, 50591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 58, "seek": 11600, "start": 120.56, "end": 121.04, "text": " I tell him.", "tokens": [50591, 314, 1560, 683, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 59, "seek": 11600, "start": 121.04, "end": 123.2, "text": " You kind of get out of here, man.", "tokens": [50615, 921, 1611, 286, 651, 503, 286, 994, 11, 582, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 60, "seek": 11600, "start": 123.2, "end": 124.08, "text": " I asked if he's alone.", "tokens": [50723, 314, 1965, 611, 339, 338, 3436, 13, 50767], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 61, "seek": 11600, "start": 124.08, "end": 125.2, "text": " He said it's just him and a friend left.", "tokens": [50767, 679, 531, 340, 338, 655, 683, 290, 257, 1545, 1364, 13, 50823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 62, "seek": 11600, "start": 125.2, "end": 126.88, "text": " The building's janitor, Jose Gonzalez.", "tokens": [50823, 383, 2615, 338, 42897, 2072, 11, 5264, 24416, 13, 50907], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 63, "seek": 11600, "start": 126.88, "end": 127.68, "text": " Ask where Jose is.", "tokens": [50907, 16981, 810, 5264, 318, 13, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 64, "seek": 11600, "start": 127.68, "end": 128.8, "text": " He says he's downstairs.", "tokens": [50947, 679, 1139, 339, 338, 34624, 13, 51003], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 65, "seek": 11600, "start": 128.8, "end": 131.84, "text": " I say we're exactly downstairs.", "tokens": [51003, 314, 910, 356, 821, 3446, 34624, 13, 51155], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 66, "seek": 11600, "start": 131.84, "end": 133.2, "text": " He says Jose's on the first floor.", "tokens": [51155, 679, 1139, 5264, 338, 319, 262, 717, 4314, 13, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 67, "seek": 11600, "start": 133.2, "end": 134.24, "text": " So I start to leave him out.", "tokens": [51223, 1406, 314, 923, 284, 2666, 683, 503, 13, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 68, "seek": 11600, "start": 134.24, "end": 135.52, "text": " As we make it down the stairs it felt like.", "tokens": [51275, 1081, 356, 787, 340, 866, 262, 16046, 340, 2936, 588, 13, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 69, "seek": 11600, "start": 135.52, "end": 138.64, "text": " 47 cruise missiles hit the lobby.", "tokens": [51339, 6298, 20382, 12798, 2277, 262, 10866, 13, 51495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 70, "seek": 11600, "start": 138.64, "end": 140.88, "text": " We took another staircase and Barry unfortunately sees too much.", "tokens": [51495, 775, 1718, 1194, 27656, 290, 14488, 12716, 7224, 1165, 881, 13, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 71, "seek": 11600, "start": 140.88, "end": 141.84, "text": " Tells the news about it.", "tokens": [51607, 14026, 82, 262, 1705, 546, 340, 13, 51655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 72, "seek": 11600, "start": 141.84, "end": 143.84, "text": " So we had to make him change his story on the scene in a few months later.", "tokens": [51655, 1406, 356, 550, 284, 787, 683, 1487, 465, 1621, 319, 262, 3715, 287, 257, 1178, 1933, 1568, 13, 51755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17633062695700025, "compression_ratio": 1.7124352331606219, "no_speech_prob": 0.15945842862129211}, {"id": 73, "seek": 14384, "start": 143.84, "end": 146.56, "text": " I'm shot him in the neck with a heart attack pellet.", "tokens": [50363, 314, 1101, 2823, 683, 287, 262, 7393, 351, 257, 2612, 1368, 16176, 1616, 13, 50499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2840899483102267, "compression_ratio": 1.4565217391304348, "no_speech_prob": 0.45891377329826355}, {"id": 74, "seek": 14384, "start": 146.56, "end": 147.76, "text": " Finally I get back to the main scene.", "tokens": [50499, 9461, 314, 651, 736, 284, 262, 1388, 3715, 13, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2840899483102267, "compression_ratio": 1.4565217391304348, "no_speech_prob": 0.45891377329826355}, {"id": 75, "seek": 14384, "start": 147.76, "end": 149.20000000000002, "text": " I find a rookie cop who looks lost.", "tokens": [50559, 314, 1064, 257, 12302, 2243, 508, 3073, 2626, 13, 50631], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2840899483102267, "compression_ratio": 1.4565217391304348, "no_speech_prob": 0.45891377329826355}, {"id": 76, "seek": 14384, "start": 149.20000000000002, "end": 150.48000000000002, "text": " I hand him the passport and say.", "tokens": [50631, 314, 1021, 683, 262, 17981, 290, 910, 13, 50695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2840899483102267, "compression_ratio": 1.4565217391304348, "no_speech_prob": 0.45891377329826355}, {"id": 77, "seek": 14384, "start": 150.48000000000002, "end": 152.64000000000001, "text": " I found the sun in the rubble over there.", "tokens": [50695, 314, 1043, 262, 4252, 287, 262, 29632, 625, 612, 13, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2840899483102267, "compression_ratio": 1.4565217391304348, "no_speech_prob": 0.45891377329826355}], "language": "en"}